                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans refused to extend the healthcare tax subsidies for 22 million Americans. So premiums for those on Obamacare will double.\n\nThey refused to talk in February, March, and April when the government was open. They refused to talk in May, June, and July when the government was open. They refused to talk in August and September when the government was open.\n\nAnd now, they refuse to talk because the government is closed. 3/4",
